WEBVTT

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:02.480
who every day feel
the vicious volley of racism

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:09.280
and every day have their
civil and human rights stripped away.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:15.216
And the people who do this
use stereotypes and myths

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.360
to justify doing it.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.440
Everywhere I go,

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:28.680
I see and hear women